# Minecraft Version(s): 26.3
## The Wilderness Bound update had lots of small technical changes which added up - so please report any Bugs you catch on our Discord server. 
## We also moved away from crowdin for our translations and now have our own solution. Feel free to contribute: https://explorerseden.eu/translate/
## Thank you!

## Changes:
- Village names shown as titles now also have an animated letterbox effect
- Village names and colors are now based on the biome instead of the villager type
- Extended database for Village names massively
- Wandering Trader trades are now data driven and were added to the pool of vanilla uncommon ones
- Removed Wandering Trader settings for trades (no longer possible)
- Added 11 progression advancements

